{"schemaVersion":1,"id":-40131,"sections":[{"id":"script-20131","name":"原始脚本 20131","scripts":[20131],"start":0,"count":48}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20131:20131:0","scriptId":20131,"text":"继续回到约塔的战场——","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20131:20131:1","scriptId":20131,"text":"战场上的战车兽已经完全清理干净，但是除了约塔以外还有软泥在一旁协助攻击，真是头疼万分。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":400,"speaker":"约塔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20131:20131:2","scriptId":20131,"text":"“怎么了？就这点本事吗？全部都躲在掩体后面当缩头乌龟吗！？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":400,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20131:20131:3","scriptId":20131,"text":"面对约塔的热光线兵器，我们基本无招架之力……这种又快又猛的武器，除了蓄力上面有点慢和发射间隔比较大以外，其他性能堪称完美。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":400,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20131:20131:4","scriptId":20131,"text":"“这简直没法玩，根本不是一个级别的战斗。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":400,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20131:20131:5","scriptId":20131,"text":"“要不我冲出去吸引一下火力？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":740,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20131:20131:6","scriptId":20131,"text":"佐伊刚准备出去，就被我一把拽了回来。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":740,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20131:20131:7","scriptId":20131,"text":"“回来！不要找死！”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":740,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":584,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20131:20131:8","scriptId":20131,"text":"“长官说得对，不能冒然出击，很容易成为活靶子。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":584,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20131:20131:9","scriptId":20131,"text":"“突围是必须的，但是战前部署也要准备好。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":584,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":745,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20131:20131:10","scriptId":20131,"text":"“哦……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":745,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20131:20131:11","scriptId":20131,"text":"“我们需要一定的火力掩护，还好约塔不像埃普西隆那样用护盾，从她刚才跳开维卡的攻击时，就可以确定我们的武器对她有效。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":745,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":572,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20131:20131:12","scriptId":20131,"text":"“那我们要趁着她的攻击间隔进行反攻？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":572,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20131:20131:13","scriptId":20131,"text":"虽然奈特莉的提议比较有意义，但是这种样子的战斗必然会导致伤亡，太拼命。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":572,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20131:20131:14","scriptId":20131,"text":"“最好的办法是我们和诺伊娜那边同时攻击，约塔只能攻击一边，这样另一边就有了攻击的机会。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":572,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":596,"speaker":"维卡","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20131:20131:15","scriptId":20131,"text":"“收到。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":596,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20131:20131:16","scriptId":20131,"text":"我刚说完，就看到维卡突然闪出去，然后发了一炮。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":596,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20131:20131:20","scriptId":20131,"text":"“那个……我还没说开始呢……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":true},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20131:20131:21","scriptId":20131,"text":"因为维卡的这下炮击，彻底吸引住了约塔。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":400,"speaker":"约塔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20131:20131:22","scriptId":20131,"text":"“啊哈～在这边吗！？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":4,"right":400,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20131:20131:23","scriptId":20131,"text":"约塔把炮口转向了维卡这边，但是这次她并没有直接攻击，而是在那里等待。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":4,"right":400,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20131:20131:24","scriptId":20131,"text":"“不好！维卡离开那个掩体！”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":4,"right":400,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":596,"speaker":"维卡","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20131:20131:25","scriptId":20131,"text":"“！！”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":4,"right":596,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20131:20131:26","scriptId":20131,"text":"维卡听到我的命令以后一个侧滑，躲到了另一片掩体之中。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":4,"right":596,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20131:20131:27","scriptId":20131,"text":"一束猛烈的光线朝着维卡所在的掩体射去。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":4,"right":596,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20131:20131:28","scriptId":20131,"text":"一瞬间功夫，之前的掩体就此消失，那道光线轻松的击穿了掩体，而剩余的光线径直飞向远方……","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":4,"right":596,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20131:20131:29","scriptId":20131,"text":"“这下麻烦了……，这兵器不能靠掩体来抵挡，简单的来说就是拥有摧毁地形的破坏力……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":4,"right":596,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20131:20131:30","scriptId":20131,"text":"“可恶！没办法了！只能主动攻击了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":4,"right":596,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20131:20131:31","scriptId":20131,"text":"“全队散开！边闪避边攻击！但是不要拉近距离！”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":4,"right":596,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20131:20131:32","scriptId":20131,"text":"我一声令下，队伍立刻分散开去。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":4,"right":596,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":400,"speaker":"约塔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"script-20131:20131:33","scriptId":20131,"text":"“哦！！终于出来了！？那么开始攻击吧！”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":4,"right":400,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20131:20131:34","scriptId":20131,"text":"一时间，炮弹与火光齐飞，整个场面非常混乱。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":4,"right":400,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20131:20131:37","scriptId":20131,"text":"海滩旁边——","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20131:20131:38","scriptId":20131,"text":"艾丽莎正在朝着另一边的战场走去。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20131:20131:39","scriptId":20131,"text":"突然她发现一道光线伴随着激烈的空气震动射向自己。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":13,"speaker":"艾丽莎","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20131:20131:40","scriptId":20131,"text":"（这是……）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":13,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20131:20131:41","scriptId":20131,"text":"还没等到艾丽莎反应，光线就直击中了艾丽莎……","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":13,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20131:20131:45","scriptId":20131,"text":"巨大的光焰爆散开来，整个过程持续了数秒。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":true},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20131:20131:46","scriptId":20131,"text":"接着，那些光线慢慢被聚拢了起来——形成了一个光球。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20131:20131:47","scriptId":20131,"text":"突然，这光球分裂成两道光线，按着射来的方向反击了回去！","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20131:20131:48","scriptId":20131,"text":"硝烟散去……","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":14,"speaker":"艾丽莎","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20131:20131:49","scriptId":20131,"text":"（……）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":14,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20131:20131:50","scriptId":20131,"text":"艾丽莎毫发无伤，但是——","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":14,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20131:20131:51","scriptId":20131,"text":"她的身上突然出现了非常多的黑色物质——聚合装甲。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":14,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":14,"speaker":"艾丽莎","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20131:20131:52","scriptId":20131,"text":"（额，刚才的紧急启动好像有点问题……）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":14,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":14,"speaker":"艾丽莎","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20131:20131:53","scriptId":20131,"text":"（我应该没有反击的意思才对，但是自动反击怎么开启了？这义体有问题啊……）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":14,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":14,"speaker":"艾丽莎","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20131:20131:54","scriptId":20131,"text":"（算了，之后问一下兰布达吧……我当没看到……原路返回……）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":14,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20131:20131:55","scriptId":20131,"text":"艾丽莎本来兴趣满满，但是因为知道自己的义体存在问题以后，便紧锁眉头，忧心忡忡地调头回去了……","background":"/art/stories/zjm-101.webp","left":14,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false}],"summaries":[]}
